WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:07.190
Students of Paprika Academy! The third term will end today!

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:12.240
It was an eventful time. This happened, and that happened.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.980
And now spring.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.910
Though it is spring, and it is indeed spring, but because it is spring... We must bid each other farewell.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:23.870
But April will bring with it a new school term, a season of wonderful new encounters!

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.830
I am certain you will all gain a fresh perspective.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:32.110
And may we meet again in good spirits when the time comes.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.260
Now go, enjoy your spring break!

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:36.290
Dismissed!

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.380
So, Lala, tomorrow's Falulu's birthday party?

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.690
Yeah! She was reborn after all.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:50.710
Manaka.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.500
We may be on break, but don't be late tomorrow.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.950
Capisce!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:02.870
The Friend Tickets from everyone are all important.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.500
Let's sort them in file bags tomorrow.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.340
Yeah. And I can't wait for the party tomorrow, Unicorn!

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.980
That's good.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:17.550
Sleep tight, so you'll be at your best tomorrow.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.790
You're so nice, Unicorn.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:24.560
Well, I've got a lot of niceness to catch up on after all that.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.010
Good night.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.520
Good night.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.950
Argh, I'm running late! See you!

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:13.880
Lala, wait!

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:17.340
This is for Lady Falulu! It matches mine.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:18.890
Capisce!

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.370
Falulu's Non, good morning.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:48.270
This one... Here...

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.800
Falulu! You're finally up.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.010
Yeah! I'll help out too!

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.540
I've got just about everything ready.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:05.070
Your hair's a bit messy.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:08.380
There! Looking real cute today!

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:11.630
Coming!

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:14.350
Welcome, one and all!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.840
Falulu!

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:16.990
Yoohoo-pri!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.070
Good day.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.470
Tension Max!

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:20.540
Relax!

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.320
We have arrived for the birthday party!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.180
Thank you everyone!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:24.980
Thank us!

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.410
Congratulations, Falulu!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.030
Go!
Pri!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.020
Big news! Big news!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.120
Babies! Something big happened-usa!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.270
What's up?

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:34.830
You're not gonna believe this-kuma!

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.440
Everyone in SoLaMi Dressing ranked up!

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.920
To the Major Class! To Popular Idols!

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.190
Really? Heck yeah!

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:49.890
I'll be hibernating in a 7LDK luxury cave-kuma!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:54.280
And I'm jumping right to the Divine Manager rank!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:55.850
What now-usa?

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:58.670
It's been a while-new.

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.100
Teiko & NewMew!

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:01.780
Huge!

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:06.030
You finally caught up to our rank-mew.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:09.520
But you still have a long way to go-new.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:11.350
<i>Good luck</i>-new.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:15.040
Wow... Becoming a Divine Idol isn't that easy, huh?

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.000
What will you do now, Falulu?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.650
Falulu was reborn.

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:24.030
Time to start over as a Sparkling New Student.

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:25.430
Right, Unicorn?

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.760
Sounds good to me.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.220
Sounds fun!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.930
Well, good luck trying to catch up to us, then!

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.120
Thanks!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:48.350
Everybody! Thank you for being here today!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:52.520
The rebirthday party of Falulu is about to start!

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.460
We brought presents.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.710
As did we, Lady Falulu!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.040
We're looking forward to more great songs.

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:05.010
Thanks, everybody!

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:06.970
Here comes the cake!

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:08.930
Thank you!

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:11.820
So sweet!

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:12.540
So salty!

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:13.390
Whuh?

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.600
How's a Red Flash taste then?

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:19.540
Stunning.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:20.560
That rough?

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:22.520
What about monja?

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.410
Cold!

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.890
It's piping hot!

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:29.110
Pizza from Papa's Pasta!

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:31.400
Spicy!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.700
No way!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:36.000
Falulu's senses are one-of-a-kind.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:41.920
You're making such funny faces!

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:48.130
Here. This is from Non.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:49.710
From Non?

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:52.740
I'm so glad!

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.940
Just like Non!

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.740
Yeah, cute!

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:01.980
Did you bring a present?

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.810
I brought...

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:08.100
A congratulatory capisce pose!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.530
Wow! That's great!

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.520
Congratulatory Kamakura!

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:16.080
What? It's congratulatory Capisce!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.160
Congratulatory Kagoshima!

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.000
Huh? That's a bit off...

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:22.750
Is it too complicated?

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:25.210
Bring it-chanko!

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.880
Scoop it, shrimper!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:35.760
It's cute, but not quite the same, is it?

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.140
It's totally off-pri.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:41.490
Most strange. What happened to her prodigious copying abilities?

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:43.270
Most likely...

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:45.040
Mr. Meganii?

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:52.980
She lost her perfect copying ability after becoming a normal girl with her own voice and will.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.270
What?

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:58.160
She was truly reborn, body and soul.

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:01.580
But I'm just happy I've finally made friends.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.730
Falulu!

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:04.930
That's right!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:14.440
Falulu! I have a present for you as well.

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:15.340
From you?

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.060
They're lilacs.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.430
What? Are those growing already?

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:24.410
I dug around for ones blooming early.

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:26.910
Because I know Falulu likes flowers.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.520
Yeah! Thanks!

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:32.990
Take care of yourself, you're headed for the top of the idol world.

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:35.020
Thank you.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:41.450
The goal of getting to the top of idols hasn't changed.

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:47.420
Of course not. Your natural talent hasn't gone anywhere.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.720
Let's take a pritograph!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.390
A pritograph?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.190
Yeah, pritograph!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.300
Here goes.

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.250
Capisce!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.720
Lovely!

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.080
Thanks! It was a lot of fun!

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:25.270
You okay? You won't be lonely with everyone leaving at once?

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.670
It's fine, Unicorn is here.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.980
Them's was good eatin-kuma

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.650
Huh? Where is Unicorn?

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:33.540
Kuma?

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.340
Usa?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:39.070
Unicorn's never disappeared without saying anything before.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:39.710
This is weird!

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:40.870
What?

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:42.080
Something's wrong!

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:46.040
Unicorn!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:48.480
Unicorn!

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:52.440
Unicorn, where are you?

00:09:57.250 --> 00:10:00.340
Ms. Unicorn, are you certain about this?

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:05.290
Yes. I'm not the manager of legend I fancied myself.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:10.060
Without the miracle SoLaMi Dressing made...

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.250
Falulu would never have woken up.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.880
I couldn't protect her.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.830
I can't forgive myself for that.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.280
I will snap my horn off and live as a mere horse.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:35.400
And I am not fit to be her manager any longer.

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:40.040
I could never keep myself from spoiling her.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:42.890
Couldn't get me off her! Smoochies all over!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:46.620
If you do indeed go so far away, you will never see her again.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:53.250
Falulu was born to reach the top of all idols.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:57.300
Find her a better, more suitable manager.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.510
Seems like you've made up your mind.

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:04.470
Yes. I will be but a horse.

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:15.640
Unicorn!

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:17.400
Miss Unicorn!

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:19.720
Are you here?

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:24.190
Ms. Unicorn is near the fountain performing the ritual of de-horning.

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.120
Ritual of de-horning?

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:35.750
Now, snap!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.940
Horse!

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:41.340
Horse.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:44.460
Wow, it just comes off?

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:47.390
Guess so, didn't even look painful-kuma.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.560
Pshu...

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.290
It is done.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.520
Very well.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:56.460
Now...

00:11:58.720 --> 00:11:59.790
Wiggity what?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:00.740
What was that all about?

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:03.200
Unicorn!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.870
What's going on, Unicorn?

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:06.160
Falulu!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.140
Unicorn!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.140
Falulu!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.730
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:26.580
What is it, Mireille?

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:31.980
I was thinking: why would Unicorn go out of her way to find flowers that usually only bloom in April?

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:36.680
Lilac is "friendship" in the language of flowers-pri.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:39.010
But that's not the only one.

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:40.690
Memories.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.380
Memories?

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.330
What's this about?

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:48.410
Unicorn's leaving, and wanted to leave Falulu the memories?

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.390
Correct-usa.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:56.540
There's nothing my long bunny ears don't hear.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:13:00.780
Unicorn has requested a transfer to another PriPara far away.

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:03.170
And that request was approved.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.870
Another PriPara? That's a thing?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:09.550
You didn't know? There's PriParas all over the place.

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:12.200
That reminds me-kuma!

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:16.020
The Legendary Manager Unicorn breaking her horn means...

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:19.020
She's quitting the business-kuma!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:19.980
What?

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:21.400
What?

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.610
They went to the roof!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.200
Let's go!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.400
Yeah!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:43.010
Unicorn! Unicorn!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.290
Unicorn!

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:46.130
Falulu?

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.470
Unicorn! Wait!

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.500
Falulu...

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:53.770
Unicorn! Are you really leaving?

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.880
And you're quitting being my manager?

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:03.440
Why? We were always together!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.220
I was sure we'd stay together!

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:08.540
Unicorn, why?

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:14.080
Being your manager...

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.790
is no longer enough for me.

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:20.980
But don't you worry about it.

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:24.570
You're all grown up now.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:26.300
And you've made so many friends.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:27.800
But...

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:31.510
I have arranged you a very skilled manager.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:35.470
This is better for you too, don't you agree?

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.310
But...

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.440
fart  fart  fart  fart

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:41.360
Just say "Yes."

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:48.830
<i>Your name is Falulu. Do you understand?</i>

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:52.020
<i>Just say "Yes."</i>

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:53.330
<i>Yeee...</i>

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.350
<i>I can't hear you.</i>

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:56.370
<i>Yes.</i>

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:57.820
<i>Yep!</i>

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:00.540
Yes...

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:03.580
I will never forget you.

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:08.120
Thank you, Falulu...

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:11.510
But...

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.430
But...

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.700
Falulu?

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:20.010
Lala! I want to follow Unicorn!

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:22.230
Unicorn was lying.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.290
Huh?

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:26.190
Her tail was twitching.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:30.600
<i>Being your manager...</i>

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:33.730
<i>is no longer enough for me.</i>

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:35.790
The tail doesn't lie.

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:36.370
Right!

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:41.540
Unicorn!

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:44.250
<i>Better and better!</i>

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:49.470
<i>You can't sleep there! Falulu!</i>

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:53.390
Unicorn! I'm coming too!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.850
Unicorn!

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:01.230
Falulu!

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:23.840
Unicorn?

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:26.110
Never do anything that dangerous again!

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:29.440
Unicorn... you're a Pegasus?

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:31.310
Come to think of it...

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:34.760
I think I really did look like this, long ago.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:35.930
I forgot all about this.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:39.840
Unicorn, I'm going with you!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:41.890
Falulu...

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:45.260
And you can't change my mind about that.

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:47.360
You've become so arrogant.

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:57.110
But very well.

00:16:57.110 --> 00:17:00.590
I'll just keep on managing then!

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:08.310
She made a horn pop out just like that? She really is the manager of legend!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.460
That long name wasn't for show-usa!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.670
Lala! I'm going with Unicorn!

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:19.640
Yeah! But we'll meet again! Promise!

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:22.010
Promise!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:26.410
It's a bit sad, but let's see her off with a smile!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:26.940
Yeah!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:27.810
Capisce!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:32.510
Hologrammation-usa!
Hologrammation-kuma!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.270
Let's go!

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:43.930
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:53.320
Go...

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:54.440
Pshu...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.200
There!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:01.660
There!

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:04.010
There! Eat it!

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:05.300
Pshu...

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:12.390
Let's play together! PriPara Hills!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.890
Good night.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:21.580
Cyalume Change!

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:26.130
Yay!

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:27.000
Go!

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:54.750
Lala! Everybody! Bye bye!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.910
See you!

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:59.580
We'll send your stuff after you-pri!

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:01.110
Text me!

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:02.560
Don't catch a cold up there!

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:03.720
Stay safe!

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:07.720
Pega!

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.380
I'm off!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:22.090
Falulu's really gone, huh?

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.200
Indeed.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.410
I wonder what she's up to now.

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:30.620
That was super cool how she just flew off all "Pega!"

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.370
Complete.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:35.790
Complete-pri!

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:36.130
Go!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.250
Complete!

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:41.530
Let's work on our skills before we meet her again!

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:44.760
So, let's get to picking a show to appear in-pri!

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:47.720
Let's turn over a new leaf. It is spring, after all.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:47.740
The Spring Live!

